      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: For Japanese for example, actual input flow as follow.\n\n1. Type in roman (reading of Japanese in english wrting format)\n\n2. Hit spacebar to change to actual Japanese then hit enter to select\n\nSo at the moment, it send when select actual Japanse than continue to type afterwards which doesnt' work for those language.\n\nWhich means.......they need to add option such as \"Enter to Send\" toggrable ot alt option to send message.",
