      "value": "@{5ce09c4ff1ef661188867ab5|full_name}: Ah, it is a bug and a feature.\n\nThe way I see it, is if the user is pressing enter for the input system, that should get ignored. So VRChat should try and fix that bug.\n\nBut yes, there should be option to require like Ctrl+enter or something to send.",
